<item><title>Cameroon rights commission urges equal treatment for election candidates</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-rights-commission-urges-equal-treatment-for-4c71e7/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-rights-commission-urges-equal-treatment-for-4c71e7/</guid><category>Cameroon</category><description>The commission cited document delays, refusals and fees as candidates prepared for legislative and municipal elections on 07 February 2027.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:04:02 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cm.jpg" length="34085" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cm.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
